Description: Remove the Update Assets menu entry from the Online Updater
 We build the retroarch-assets package to provide these files and updates
 should be handled by APT as they are installed under /usr. Eliminating this
 entry removes the potential for confusion about this issue with users.
Author: Peter J. Mello <admin@petermello.net>
Origin: other
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2025-07-02

